  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Description: Dress up your AirPods in style with our Pearl Charm Bow Cases. Featuring an adorable 3D bow design with delicate pearl details, these cases add a touch of elegance while keeping your AirPods safe from scratches and dust. Each case comes with a matching pearl bracelet charm, making it both fashionable and functional—perfect for carrying or attaching to your bag. Available in sweet pink and classic white, they’re the ultimate mix of cute and classy for your everyday look.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Dress up your AirPods in style with our Pearl Charm Bow Cases. Featuring an adorable 3D bow design with delicate pearl details, these cases add a touch of elegance while keeping your AirPods safe from scratches and dust. Each case comes with a matching pearl bracelet charm, making it both fashionable and functional—perfect for carrying or attaching to your bag. Available in sweet pink and classic white, they’re the ultimate mix of cute and classy for your everyday look.</p>"
